<title>GERMANY: Viag details Q1 97 results.</title>
<headline>Viag details Q1 97 results.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     674     vs 668</p>
<p>    Group sales				  12,283  vs 10,863</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Energy					2,744   vs 2,707</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   1,316   vs 1,031</p>
<p>     Packaging				   3,233   vs 2,795</p>
<p>     Logistics				   4,939   vs 4,376</p>
<p>     Other areas				 126     vs 124</p>
<p>     Intercompany sales			-75     vs -170 (loss)</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure			395     vs 394</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Energy					188     vs 148</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   64	vs 38</p>
<p>     Packaging				   105     vs 173</p>
<p>     Logistics				   35	vs 33</p>
</text>
